      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — King Dedede.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 2, power rating 3 → CR 2 as a boss. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Penguin-Shaped Diplomatic Incident</strong> — Kingdom of Dreamland</p><p>Status: Active, loud, diplomatically radioactive</p><p>King Dedede is the monarch of Dreamland and the living embodiment of why some kingdoms should maybe consider term limits. He sits on the Fountain of Dreams—one of the most important pieces of magical infrastructure in the region—and treats every conversation like it should be about him. Waluigi has met egomaniacs before. Waluigi has WORKED with egomaniacs. Waluigi's business partner is WARIO. But Dedede operates on a level of self-absorption that makes Wario look humble, and Wario once built a statue of himself that was visible from SPACE.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Royal Mallet</strong> — “King Dedede is the monarch of Dreamland and the living embodiment of why some kingdoms should maybe consider term limits.”</li><li><strong>Diplomatic Incident</strong> — “Active, loud, diplomatically radioactive”</li><li><strong>Term Limits Not Observed</strong> — “King Dedede is the monarch of Dreamland and the living embodiment of why some kingdoms should maybe consider term limits.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/king_dedede</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/king_dedede</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
